OL,12,     Ftraffic cops tackle a huge variety
OL,13,     Fof criminals, ranging from drunk
OL,14,     For drugged drivers to violent
OL,15,     Fcounty lines drug dealers and
OL,16,     Forganised crime gangs.
OL,17,G1300 Traffic Cops
